WEBVTT

00:22:28.276 --> 00:22:32.156
And what happens
when commodity prices spike up

00:22:32.196 --> 00:22:35.956
and we have severe supply chain challenges
with energy and food,

00:22:35.996 --> 00:22:38.076
and those things
are obviously very related.

00:22:38.116 --> 00:22:40.796
What happens is that a lot of people die.

00:22:41.236 --> 00:22:43.396
What happens is we see
a lot more starvation.

00:22:43.396 --> 00:22:48.196
The World Food Organization says about 10
million people a year die of starvation.

00:22:48.236 --> 00:22:51.236
That number in the next 12 months
is going to be a lot higher

00:22:51.236 --> 00:22:52.876
than it otherwise would have been.

00:22:52.876 --> 00:22:55.476
The number of people
who are food stressed in the world

00:22:55.476 --> 00:22:58.196
is going to go way up
in sub-Saharan Africa, in Yemen,

00:22:58.236 --> 00:23:00.196
in Afghanistan, in Bangladesh.